# OmniDoc — Cursor ignore (Agent / Tab / @ / indexing hardening)
#
# Why this file exists:
# - `.gitignore` mainly affects indexing. `.cursorignore` also blocks Agent,
#   Tab, Inline Edit, and @-mentions (best-effort).
# - Cursor already ignores lockfiles, `.env*`, `node_modules/`, media, and
#   many binaries by default. This file is defense-in-depth + JVM/Nx noise.
#
# Do NOT ignore: `docs/`, `context.md`, `architecture.md`, `AGENTS.md`,
# `MEMORY.md`, handoffs, ADRs, `apps/*/src`, `packages/*/src`, `.cursor/agents/`.
# Growing Markdown is managed by handoff read-order, not by ignoring docs.

# --- Secrets (never feed to models) ---
.env
.env.*
!.env.example
!.env.*.example
**/*.pem
**/*.p12
**/*.keystore
**/secrets/**
**/credentials.json
**/service-account*.json
.cursor/mcp.local.json
.cursor/mcp.*.local.json
**/mcp.secrets.json

# --- Dependencies ---
node_modules/
**/node_modules/
.pnp
.pnp.js
.yarn/
.pnpm-store/

# --- Frontend / Node build & caches ---
**/dist/
**/out/
**/.next/
**/.nuxt/
**/.svelte-kit/
**/.output/
**/.vercel/
**/.netlify/
**/.turbo/
**/.vite/
**/.vitest/
**/.parcel-cache/
**/.cache/
coverage/
**/.nyc_output/
storybook-static/
*.tsbuildinfo
.eslintcache
.stylelintcache

# --- Nx ---
.nx/cache/
.nx/workspace-data/

# --- Java / Gradle (apps/api) ---
**/.gradle/
**/build/
!docs/**/build/
**/bin/
**/out/
*.class
*.jar
!**/gradle/wrapper/gradle-wrapper.jar
*.war
*.ear
hs_err_pid*
replay_pid*

# --- Test / e2e artifacts ---
test-results/
playwright-report/
blob-report/
cypress/videos/
cypress/screenshots/
**/jacoco/
**/test-output/

# --- Local scratch / OS / IDE ---
.tmp/
.temp/
*.local
.DS_Store
Thumbs.db
.idea/
*.iml
*.swp
*.swo
*~

# --- Logs ---
logs/
*.log
npm-debug.log*
